@launches_host = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{launches_host}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### [SUCESSO] Criar lançamento válido (credit)
POST {{launches_host}}/api/launches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.75,
  "type": "credit",
  "occurredOnUtc": "2026-04-26T12:00:00Z"
}

###

### [SUCESSO] Criar lançamento válido (debit)
POST {{launches_host}}/api/launches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50.00,
  "type": "debit",
  "occurredOnUtc": "2026-04-26T12:05:00Z"
}

###

### [ERRO DE VALIDAÇÃO] Amount inválido (<= 0)
POST {{launches_host}}/api/launches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0,
  "type": "credit",
  "occurredOnUtc": "2026-04-26T12:10:00Z"
}

###

### [ERRO DE VALIDAÇÃO] Type inválido
POST {{launches_host}}/api/launches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "type": "transfer",
  "occurredOnUtc": "2026-04-26T12:15:00Z"
}

###

### [ERRO DE VALIDAÇÃO] Payload malformado (campo obrigatório ausente)
POST {{launches_host}}/api/launches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "type": "credit"
}